{"id":"vod_sn_35548","vodId":"35548","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我们无法一起学习第一季","name_cn":"我们无法一起学习第一季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/54e4867df0a2dceb261531ee72b6535f.jpg"},"summary":"唯我成幸（逢坂良太 配音）是一个看上去非常平凡的青年，唯一的优势就是每门学科都取得了很好的成绩。学校里有一个可以免除考试以及学费的特别VIP推荐名额，为了得到这个名额，成幸主动提出要担任帮助同学学习的教育指导员的职位。　　被称为“文学之森的睡美人”的千金大小姐古桥文乃（白石晴香 配音）、被称为“机关精巧的拇指姑娘”的理科健将绪方理珠（富田美忧 配音）、被称为“白银的漆黑人鱼公主”的游泳部种子选手武元润香（铃代纱弓 配音），需要成幸辅导的，是这三位校园里的传奇人物。原本以为是非常轻松的工作，没想到这三个姑娘虽然在某一方面非常优秀，但在不擅长的科目上真的是令人大跌眼镜。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YzdExaErjB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mEQLvDCB5h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R3FdNFEtLi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p3pUHRfzsY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m29r0LYi871/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bMsFvRZSvQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fbAmyjTp6z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u8GatqjRNV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rKL5m44NRz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6iSSZzyr9F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PtcVaxKZB71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sf0fkYWND01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z7uP1vYQKC1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.900Z"}